learn how to link a css file to html stucture
 <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>index5</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style5.css"> <========ADD LINK (CSS FILE) HERE UNDER THE TITLE>

</head>